From 974a071139a4b90945268938106122f34c44fe0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 15:17:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(scripts): CSPRNG in dkg.js; rewrite broken full_verify.js
 as child_process parallel verifier

- dkg.js: replace Math.random() with crypto.randomBytes CSPRNG (DKG generates real
  committee secret-key shares; predictable RNG would make threshold keys recoverable).
- full_verify.js: previous version was non-functional (undefined 'replay', omitted
  crypto helpers, and a literal '...)' syntax error). Rewritten as a child_process.fork
  based parallel runner that embeds the verified replay_harness.js logic; each child is
  a clean main-thread node process, avoiding the worker_threads/web-worker nesting that
  produced spurious TypeErrors. Verified: clean output, correct winner-only match counts.
---
 circuits/scripts/dkg.js                  |   4 +-
 dao-vote-gas-test/scripts/full_verify.js | 147 ++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 119 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

